<p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: #ffffff">WHY HEDDI</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Noto Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(56px, 7vw, 104px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #ffffff">About</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Noto Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.45; color: #ffffff">Derived from the Lao phrase meaning "do good," Heddi is our standard for every decision.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; color: #ffffff">At Heddi Strategies, we believe strategy should create both business value and social good. We help leaders make decisions that strengthen organizations and communities at the same time.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; color: #ffffff">Our work combines strategic rigor with human-centered thinking so our partners can grow responsibly, build trust, and create durable impact.</p>
</div>
